        },
        {
          "@id": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/fact/fact_01M5Z6B47N01AGSZDB6KW7YP73",
          "@type": "rs:Fact",
          "decimals": "2",
          "element": "rs-gaap:Liabilities",
          "entity": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/entity/entity_kg1a1665d67779b4676fa4",
          "factSet": "https://robosystems.ai/factset/fs_01M5Z6B470687GG9B6JMH0PMS8",
          "factType": "numeric",
          "internalId": "fact_01M5Z6B47N01AGSZDB6KW7YP73",
          "numericValue": "37644.44",
          "period": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/period/p_3",
          "prov:wasAttributedTo": {
            "@id": "rollup:calculation"
          },
          "rs:sourceKind": "rollup",
          "structure": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/structure/b6dfb8d2-8ee9-5597-9a3b-8aeee625ff0d",
          "unit": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/unit/u_USD"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/fact/fact_01M5Z6B485MW59C7ZG3T8NB3EB",
          "@type": "rs:Fact",
          "element": "driftline:InventoryPolicyTextBlock",
          "entity": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/entity/entity_kg1a1665d67779b4676fa4",
          "factSet": "https://robosystems.ai/factset/fs_01M5Z6B481816JREZFBBVTP0EK",
          "factType": "nonnumeric",
          "internalId": "fact_01M5Z6B485MW59C7ZG3T8NB3EB",
          "language": "en",
          "period": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/period/p_2",
          "stringValue": "<h1>Inventory &amp; Cost of Goods Sold Policy — Driftline Coffee Roasters</h1>\n<h2>Method</h2>\n<p>Inventory is carried at cost (FIFO). Green coffee is purchased in bulk from the importer ahead of demand, roasted, and sold through DTC and wholesale channels.</p>\n<h2>Lifecycle</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Purchase</strong> — green coffee received from the importer: DR Inventory — Green Coffee (1400) / CR Cash or Accounts Payable (2000). Cash leaves the business when the coffee is bought, not when it is sold.</li>\n<li><strong>Sale / consumption</strong> — when finished coffee is sold, recognize cost of goods sold: DR Cost of Goods Sold (5000) / CR Inventory — Green Coffee (1400).</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Watch-out: the cash trap</h2>\n<p>Buying green coffee ahead of a wholesale launch or the holiday season builds the Inventory asset and drains cash <em>before</em> the corresponding revenue and COGS are recognized. A month can show strong gross profit while operating cash falls — the difference is sitting in inventory. During close, compare the change in inventory to the change in cash.</p>\n<h2>Gross Margin</h2>\n<p>Target blended gross margin ≈ 55%. Investigate months where COGS as a share of revenue moves materially off trend.</p>",
          "structure": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/structure/struct_01M5Z6A8E2DRZCP1HF16V09A49"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/fact/fact_01M5Z6B485MW59C7ZG3T8NB3EC",
          "@type": "rs:Fact",
          "element": "driftline:DepreciationPolicyTextBlock",
          "entity": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/entity/entity_kg1a1665d67779b4676fa4",
          "factSet": "https://robosystems.ai/factset/fs_01M5Z6B481816JREZFBBVTP0EK",
          "factType": "nonnumeric",
          "internalId": "fact_01M5Z6B485MW59C7ZG3T8NB3EC",
          "language": "en",
          "period": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/period/p_2",
          "stringValue": "<h1>Depreciation &amp; Prepaid Policy — Driftline Coffee Roasters</h1>\n<h2>Depreciation</h2>\n<p>Straight-line, no salvage value unless specified. Entry: DR Depreciation Expense (7000) / CR Accumulated Depreciation (1550).</p>\n<p>| Asset | Cost | Useful Life | Monthly |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Roasting &amp; Packaging Equipment | $90,000.00 | 84 months | $1,071.43 |\n| Automated Packaging Line | $24,000.00 | 60 months | $400.00 |</p>\n<h2>Prepaid Expense Amortization</h2>\n<p>Purchases with a term greater than one month are capitalized and amortized straight-line. Entry: DR expense / CR prepaid account.</p>\n<p>| Item | Cost | Term | Monthly | Debit | Credit |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Business Insurance | $12,000.00 | 12 months | $1,000.00 | Insurance (6500) | Prepaid Insurance (1200) |\n| Annual Platform Prepay | $6,000.00 | 12 months | $500.00 | Software &amp; Subscriptions (6400) | Prepaid Software (1210) |</p>\n<p>During each close, review prepaid and fixed-asset accounts for new purchases that lack a schedule, and create one.</p>",
          "structure": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/structure/struct_01M5Z6A8E2DRZCP1HF16V09A49"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/fact/fact_01M5Z6B485MW59C7ZG3T8NB3ED",
          "@type": "rs:Fact",
          "element": "driftline:RevenueRecognitionPolicyTextBlock",
          "entity": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/entity/entity_kg1a1665d67779b4676fa4",
          "factSet": "https://robosystems.ai/factset/fs_01M5Z6B481816JREZFBBVTP0EK",
          "factType": "nonnumeric",
          "internalId": "fact_01M5Z6B485MW59C7ZG3T8NB3ED",
          "language": "en",
          "period": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/period/p_2",
          "stringValue": "<h1>Revenue Recognition Policy — Driftline Coffee Roasters</h1>\n<h2>Standard</h2>\n<p>Revenue is recognized under ASC 606 as control of the coffee transfers to the customer.</p>\n<h2>Channels</h2>\n<p>| Channel | Account | Recognition Timing | Cash Timing |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| DTC Subscriptions | Subscription Revenue — DTC (4000) | Ratably as each month's coffee ships | <strong>Prepaid</strong> — billed a quarter ahead into Deferred Subscription Revenue (2300) |\n| DTC Single Orders | Single-Order Revenue — DTC (4200) | On shipment | Immediate (card at checkout) |\n| Wholesale | Wholesale Revenue (4100) | On delivery to the grocer/café | <strong>Net 30</strong> — builds Accounts Receivable (1100) |</p>\n<h2>Deferred Subscription Revenue</h2>\n<p>Subscriber prepayments are a liability until the coffee ships. Each month:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DR Deferred Subscription Revenue (2300) / CR Subscription Revenue — DTC (4000) for the month earned.</li>\n<li>The deferred balance is cash already collected for future shipments — a source of working capital.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Wholesale Accounts Receivable</h2>\n<p>Wholesale sells on net-30 terms. Receivables that age past 60 days, or that concentrate in a single large account, are a working-capital and credit risk — review the AR aging by customer every close.</p>",
          "structure": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5Z6B3VBT6AX0H67HDPCYH3K/structure/struct_01M5Z6A8E2DRZCP1HF16V09A49"
        },
